# Tool versions — single source of truth for pinned tooling.
# CI (`.github/workflows/*.yml`) reads these versions; keep in sync with the
# Dockerfile (sensei-rs/Dockerfile) base images and rust-toolchain.toml.
#
# Zig: the version AND the pinned sha256 of its x86_64-linux archive
# (zig-x86_64-linux-${VERSION}.tar.xz — the 0.15.x naming; the obsolete
# zig-linux-x86_64-* archive name is gone). scripts/install-zig.sh consumes
# both lines; the Dockerfile mirrors both inline (its build context is
# sensei-rs/ and cannot read this file).
zig 0.15.2
zig_archive_sha256 02aa270f183da276e5b5920b1dac44a63f1a49e55050ebde3aecc9eb82f93239

# Trunk (Leptos WASM bundler): pinned so `cargo install trunk --version
